# /etc/waxseal/openclaw-ingest.env — for waxseal-openclaw-ingest.service
#
#   install -o root -g waxseal -m 0640 \
#     openclaw-ingest.env.example /etc/waxseal/openclaw-ingest.env
#
# NO REAL VALUES IN THIS FILE. It is an example in a public repository.

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Where the trail is written. ABSOLUTE, and never a leading `~`.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# resolve_trail() (integrations/_trail.py) takes this value VERBATIM and
# REFUSES one that begins with a tilde, falling back to the host default with
# a labelled notice on stderr. Its docstring names unit files as the reason:
# no shell runs between this file and the process, so a `~` survives and the
# writer creates a directory literally called `~` under its cwd. Expanding it
# here instead was rejected — a deployment already running with a literal `~`
# directory would have its old trail stay put while new appends went
# elsewhere, which looks exactly like a truncated chain.
#
# Must be under the unit's ReadWritePaths=.
#
#WAXSEAL_TRAIL=/var/lib/waxseal/openclaw/trail.jsonl

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OpenClaw's own state directory, if it is not the default.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The ingester's DEFAULT trail location is derived from this when
# WAXSEAL_TRAIL is unset. Under a system unit with ProtectHome=yes there is no
# usable home directory, so set one of the two ABSOLUTELY rather than relying
# on ~/.openclaw.
#OPENCLAW_HOME=/var/lib/openclaw

# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The gateway, if the openclaw CLI needs telling.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Whatever `openclaw` itself reads. The unit needs the `openclaw` CLI on its
# PATH and a running gateway to answer it; if either is missing the run exits
# non-zero rather than reporting a successful pass that ingested nothing.
#OPENCLAW_GATEWAY_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8080
